              "text": "sneha is built on the root √snih, \"to be sticky, oily\" (MW), which you met in snihyati. It first meant \"grease, oiliness\" and then \"love\" (CDIAL 13802): affection is what sticks. Sindhi nehu, \"affection\", comes from it."
